[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5176.83, "timestamp": "01:26:16", "text": "而且，是两个，对吧？我应该走了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5199.43, "timestamp": "01:26:39", "text": "所以，是的，保险箱大概是四四"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5204.07, "timestamp": "01:26:44", "text": "第四槽，呃，四个方块，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5206.149, "timestamp": "01:26:46", "text": "这太方便了。而不是这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5210.79, "timestamp": "01:26:50", "text": "整个装置可以放一样东西，打开它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5213.149, "timestamp": "01:26:53", "text": "你有八分之四。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5216.07, "timestamp": "01:26:56", "text": "老虎机。与上一个类似。这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5219.669, "timestamp": "01:26:59", "text": "真方便。不。而且你还可以分配。"}]